    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_steps_body",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 108,
      "width": 368,
      "height": 198,
      "text": "1. Rebuild StateTree root from 5 leaves + paths\n2. stateCommitment = H(stateRoot, stateSalt)\n   equals final ProcessMessages state commitment\n3. For each leaf:\n   H(votes_i[0..4]) == stateLeaf_i.voteOptionRoot\n4. Current tally:\n   batch 0  -> currentTallyCommitment = 0\n   batch >0 -> H(H(currentResults), currentSalt)\n5. Add encoded votes:\n   newResults[j] = currentResults[j] + sum tallyVote(v_ij)\n   tallyVote(v) = v * (v + 10^24)\n6. newTallyCommitment = H(H(newResults), newSalt)\n7. inputHash binds public fields",
      "originalText": "1. Rebuild StateTree root from 5 leaves + paths\n2. stateCommitment = H(stateRoot, stateSalt)\n   equals final ProcessMessages state commitment\n3. For each leaf:\n   H(votes_i[0..4]) == stateLeaf_i.voteOptionRoot\n4. Current tally:\n   batch 0  -> currentTallyCommitment = 0\n   batch >0 -> H(H(currentResults), currentSalt)\n5. Add encoded votes:\n   newResults[j] = currentResults[j] + sum tallyVote(v_ij)\n   tallyVote(v) = v * (v + 10^24)\n6. newTallyCommitment = H(H(newResults), newSalt)\n7. inputHash binds public fields",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
